803	     * Adjusts a date so it falls on a business day, rolling forward off weekends and public
804	     * holidays. A Saturday, Sunday or {@link #PUBLIC_HOLIDAYS listed public holiday} is rolled
805	     * forward one day at a time until the first non-holiday weekday is reached; any other weekday is
806	     * returned unchanged. Applied to the effective registration date so that a weekend or holiday
807	     * value - whether supplied in the request or defaulted to the server date - is stored as the
808	     * next business day, and every value derived from the registration date (such as the membership
809	     * number's year segment and the daily create-limit bucket) uses the adjusted business day.
